OL,4,BStruggling Blackpool sack head coach   
OL,5,BEvatt                                  
OL,6,GBlackpool have sacked head coach Ian   
OL,7,GEvatt after a year in charge following 
OL,8,Ga run of one win and six defeats in    
OL,9,Gtheir past 10 league games.            
OL,11,FEvatt's final match was Saturday's 1-0 
OL,12,Faway defeat by fellow strugglers AFC   
OL,13,FWimbledon, leaving the Tangerines      
OL,14,Fimmediately above the League One       
OL,15,Frelegation zone.                       
OL,17,FThat defeat, however, came after the   
OL,18,F45-year-old said his squad had been    
OL,19,Fdecimated by a sickness bug during     
OL,20,Ftheir trip to the capital.             
